@startuml
!theme plain
title 实际 TransferStateMachine（代码允许边，不等于所有边都已 LIVE）
hide empty description
[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> VALIDATING
VALIDATING --> PENDING_APPROVAL
VALIDATING --> RISK_REVIEW
VALIDATING --> FAILED
RISK_REVIEW --> PENDING_APPROVAL
RISK_REVIEW --> PENDING_CORE_POSTING
RISK_REVIEW --> FAILED
PENDING_APPROVAL --> PENDING_CORE_POSTING
PENDING_APPROVAL --> FAILED
PENDING_CORE_POSTING --> PENDING_CLEARING
PENDING_CORE_POSTING --> FAILED
PENDING_CLEARING --> CORE_RESULT_UNKNOWN
PENDING_CLEARING --> SETTLED
PENDING_CLEARING --> FAILED
CORE_RESULT_UNKNOWN --> SETTLED
CORE_RESULT_UNKNOWN --> FAILED
SETTLED --> REVERSAL_PENDING
SETTLED --> RETURN_PENDING
RETURN_PENDING --> RETURN_RESULT_UNKNOWN
RETURN_PENDING --> RETURNED
RETURN_RESULT_UNKNOWN --> RETURNED
REVERSAL_PENDING --> REVERSED
REVERSAL_PENDING --> SETTLED
state TIMED_OUT
note right of TIMED_OUT: 枚举存在，当前规则没有进入边
note right of CORE_RESULT_UNKNOWN
  状态允许边与业务守卫要共同阅读
  不能把未知直接解释成拒绝
end note
@enduml
